  "description": "Make the monorepo ready for one logical worktree edited live by 50+ machines (macOS, Windows, Linux) in about 5 groups of 10, each group with its own NFS server and cache server. Shared files are exactly the files the root .gitignore does not ignore; ignored files stay local. Replaces branches, merges and merge queues with a local replica per machine plus an event journal and content-addressed blobs on the group NFS store, relayed between groups. All build results go through the group cache server.",
